<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina estimates sorghum output of 2.56 mln T.</title>
<headline>Argentina estimates sorghum output of 2.56 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine 1996/97 sorghum production should total 2.56 million tonnes, up from 2.13 million tonnes the season before, the government's Agricultural Secretariat said Friday.</p>
<p>Sorghum sowing was 55.1 percent by April 25, according to the Secretariat's latest crop report Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
